## The box of rich text (record 0112): a stretch of a text in which the look is set by hand, as in a word processor

# The name of such a stretch: at its head in the text, and in the Insert menu, where it puts one in.
byhand-name = Formatert tekst
# The button at the head of such a stretch, shown as three dots, which opens the menu of the stretch.
byhand-menu = Mer
# In that menu: selects everything the stretch holds.
byhand-select = Merk
# In that menu: the stretch becomes ordinary text again; what it holds stays where it is.
byhand-to-text = Gjør til vanlig tekst
# In that menu: takes the stretch away with everything in it.
byhand-delete = Slett
# The title of the question asked before the first such stretch is put into a project that is shared with others through a server.
byhand-shared-title = Formatert tekst i et delt prosjekt
# The question itself. An earlier Glaukopis does not know rich text and would delete it, so the server keeps such a version out of the project from now on. "Then" is when they have updated.
byhand-shared = Formatert tekst er nytt. De som deler dette prosjektet med en eldre versjon av Glaukopis, holdes ute av det til de har oppdatert. Det de skriver i mellomtiden, tas vare på og sendes med da.
# The button that goes on and puts the stretch in.
byhand-shared-put = Sett inn
